    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "CHARMING DETACHED RESIDENCE ON C. 1 ACRE - FOR SALE BY PUBLIC AUCTION (CASH BUYERS ONLY)\r\n\r\nCopeland house is set in a nice quiet country setting on an elevated site with commanding views of the surrounding countryside. Approached through a stone recessed entrance to a long gravel drive leading up the the house with a paddock to rear. The house was built in 2009 containing circa 85 sq.m. (915 sq.ft.) of accommodation with the benefit of oil fired central heating, sash double glazed windows and granite sills. The house offers a wonderful open living space, on entering the home you have a large kitchen/living room with fitted kitchen presses and laminate floor, there there is a staircase leading to the first floor with a large bedroom and bathroom off. This property offers ideal opportunity to get away from the hustle and bustle of everyday life but yet easily accessible to the surrounding towns of Dunlavin (3 km), Kilcullen (14 km), Blessington (15 km), Naas (21 km) and Newbridge (20 km), offering a wide range of amenities including superb shopping, educational, recreational facilities.\r\n\r\nSituated 2 km west of the N81 which provides direct access to the M50 c. 36 km and to the Northwest you have access to the M9 at Junction 2 (c. 14 km). The area has the benefit of some good sporting activities to include GAA, soccer, horse riding, hill walking, water pursuits in Blessington and some fine golf courses to include Tulfarris, Rathsallagh, Baltinglass, Naas, Palmerstown to name a few.\r\n\r\nOUTSIDE\r\nApproached by a stone recessed entrance leading to a long gravel drive leading up to the house with a paddock to rear in grass.\r\n\r\nSERVICES\r\nMains water, septic tank drainage, oil fired central heating, electricity.\r\n\r\nAUCTION DETAILS\r\nFor Sale by Public Auction, Thursday 8th October @ 2pm in The Keadeen Hotel, Newbridge, Co. Kildare."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Accommodation\r\n\r\nKitchen/Living (16.73 x 27.23 ft) (5.10 x 8.30 m)\r\nWith laminate floor, built-in ground and eye level presses, tiled surround, electric oven, electric hob, extractor, s.s. sink unit, plumbed and french doors leading to outside.\r\n\r\nUpper Landing\r\n\r\nBedroom -other (16.73 x 18.04 ft) (5.10 x 5.50 m)\r\nWith laminate floor.\r\n\r\nBathroom\r\nw.c., w.h.b., bath with shower attachment, electric shower and laminate floor."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Charming detached property on c. 1 acre\r\nElevated site with views of surrounding countryside\r\nStone recessed driveway\r\nPaddock to rear\r\nSash windows\r\nGranite sills\r\nEasily accessible to amenities closeby"
      },
